    "extraction_notes": [
      "Figure 7 transfer curves were digitized for 25 degC and 125 degC; the figure does not specify VDS.",
      "Figure 5 output characteristics were digitized for VGS = 1.5 V, 2 V, and 2.5 V; additional VGS curves are present but are not included.",
      "Figure 10 capacitance curves were digitized for Ciss, Coss, and Crss with linear VDS and capacitance axes; the figure does not specify frequency or temperature.",
      "The electrical table also publishes IDSS max 1 uA at VDS = 20 V and VGS = 0 V; the schema has no IDSS property.",
      "The electrical table publishes Qg typ 5.4 nC, Qgs typ 0.65 nC, and Qgd typ 1.6 nC at VDS = 10 V, VGS = 4.5 V, and ID = 3 A; the schema has no gate-charge properties.",
      "The electrical table publishes switching times with RG = 6 ohm and RL = 5.5 ohm; the schema has no switching-time properties.",
      "The datasheet publishes VSD only as a maximum of 1.2 V at IS = 1 A; no typical VSD value is given.",
      "The datasheet publishes RthetaJA max 100 degC/W on a 1 in2 FR-4 board with 2 oz copper; the schema has no thermal-resistance properties.",
      "The tabulated terminal capacitances and Figure 10 capacitance curves are transcribed separately without reconciliation."
